<title>UK: BayerVB plans 1.0 bln mark Pfandbrief bond.</title>
<headline>BayerVB plans 1.0 bln mark Pfandbrief bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Vereinsbank plans to launch a 1.0 billion mark Pfandbrief bond as early as tomorrow, it said on Monday.</p>
<p>Bayerische Vereinsbank, Caisse des Depots et Consignations, Dresdner Bank, Goldman Sachs and Merrill Lynch will be joint lead managers.</p>
<p>The deal will use a fixed-price reoffer structure over the five-year government bond, BayerVB said. The launch spread will be 30 basis points over the Obl 119.</p>
<p>-- Aline van Duyn, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
